OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists say town is in grip of
OL,4,Atraffic 'carnage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has apologised for traffic
OL,7,Fdisruption described as by one taxi
OL,8,Fworker as "carnage".
OL,10,FWork on a new cycle route, along with
OL,11,Femergency repairs to a sinkhole and
OL,12,Fother roadworks, are contributing to
OL,13,Fdisruption in Spalding, Lincolnshire.
OL,15,FChris Pearson, a passenger assistant
OL,16,Ffor Spalding Smart Cabs, said traffic
OL,17,Fin the town was "a nightmare".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
